flowchart TD
  RES[Result Ops ordered] --> PROF[load profile]
  PROF --> LOOP[next Op]
  LOOP --> K{known under profile?}
  K -->|no| U[ignore / soft-fail / strict
no kernel panic]
  K -->|yes| AP[apply payload pure data]
  AP --> LF[record landed or failed]
  U --> LF
  LF --> MORE{more Ops?}
  MORE -->|yes| LOOP
  MORE -->|no| RCPT[optional Receipt]
  RCPT --> HOST[Host may annotate lineage]
